# ============================================================
# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 本项目部署目标是 Linux。Windows 检出时若脚本变成 CRLF，
# 到服务器上会报 `bash: $'\r': command not found` 或
# `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`。
# 这里显式钉死，避免依赖各机器的 core.autocrlf 设置。
# ============================================================

* text=auto eol=lf

# ---------- 二进制 ----------
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.zip   binary

# ---------- GitHub 语言统计与 diff 展示 ----------
# 第三方库与构建产物不计入语言占比，diff 里默认折叠
resources/vendor/**     linguist-vendored
resources/css/tailwind.css linguist-generated
package-lock.json       linguist-generated
